# Contact form — Web3Forms (https://web3forms.com)
# 1. Enter simon@toporderdigital.com.au at web3forms.com, get the free access key from the email.
# 2. Copy this file to `.env` and paste the key below.
# 3. Cloudflare Pages: add the same variable under Settings → Environment variables.
# The key is a public submit token (safe to expose in the built HTML) — it only lets
# a form post to your inbox, it can't read anything.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key-here
